<!doctype html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
<meta charset="utf-8">
<meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1">
<meta name="generator" content="AegisScan {{ result.version }}">
<title>Security assessment: {{ result.target.host }}</title>
<style>
:root {
  --bg: #f4f5f7; --surface: #ffffff; --ink: #1b2330; --muted: #5d6878; --line: #dfe3ea;
  --accent: #1f3a5f; --code-bg: #f1f3f6; --code-ink: #1b2330;
  --critical: #7a1fa2; --high: #c62828; --medium: #c56a00; --low: #1767b3; --info: #5f6f82;
}
@media (prefers-color-scheme: dark) {
  :root {
    --bg: #11151b; --surface: #1a2029; --ink: #e6eaf0; --muted: #9aa5b5; --line: #2c3542;
    --accent: #8fb4e3; --code-bg: #121820; --code-ink: #d7dde6;
    --critical: #c77ddf; --high: #ef6f6c; --medium: #e8a23d; --low: #6aaeea; --info: #93a1b3;
  }
}
* { box-sizing: border-box; }
html { -webkit-text-size-adjust: 100%; }
body {
  margin: 0; background: var(--bg); color: var(--ink);
  font: 15px/1.55 -apple-system, "Segoe UI", Roboto, "Helvetica Neue", Arial, sans-serif;
}
.page { max-width: 1040px; margin: 0 auto; padding: 0 20px 64px; }
a { color: var(--accent); }
h1, h2, h3 { line-height: 1.25; margin: 0; }
h2 { font-size: 20px; margin: 44px 0 14px; padding-bottom: 8px; border-bottom: 2px solid var(--line); }
p { margin: 0 0 10px; }
code, pre { font-family: "Cascadia Mono", Consolas, "SF Mono", Menlo, monospace; font-size: 12.5px; }
code { background: var(--code-bg); padding: 1px 5px; border-radius: 4px; overflow-wrap: anywhere; }

header.cover { padding: 40px 0 26px; border-bottom: 1px solid var(--line); }
.brand { font-size: 12px; letter-spacing: .14em; text-transform: uppercase; color: var(--muted); font-weight: 600; }
header.cover h1 { font-size: 30px; margin: 8px 0 6px; }
.target { font-size: 17px; overflow-wrap: anywhere; }
.facts { display: flex; flex-wrap: wrap; gap: 6px 28px; margin-top: 16px; color: var(--muted); font-size: 13px; }
.facts b { color: var(--ink); font-weight: 600; }
nav.toc { margin-top: 18px; font-size: 13px; display: flex; flex-wrap: wrap; gap: 4px 18px; }

.card { background: var(--surface); border: 1px solid var(--line); border-radius: 10px; padding: 18px 20px; }
.tiles { display: grid; grid-template-columns: repeat(5, 1fr); gap: 10px; margin-bottom: 14px; }
.tile { background: var(--surface); border: 1px solid var(--line); border-top: 4px solid var(--sev); border-radius: 8px; padding: 12px 14px; }
.tile .n { font-size: 28px; font-weight: 700; line-height: 1.1; font-variant-numeric: tabular-nums; }
.tile .l { font-size: 12px; text-transform: uppercase; letter-spacing: .08em; color: var(--muted); }
.tile.zero .n { color: var(--muted); font-weight: 500; }
.bar { display: flex; height: 10px; border-radius: 5px; overflow: hidden; background: var(--line); margin-bottom: 16px; }
.bar span { background: var(--sev); }
.critical { --sev: var(--critical); } .high { --sev: var(--high); } .medium { --sev: var(--medium); }
.low { --sev: var(--low); } .info { --sev: var(--info); }

table { border-collapse: collapse; width: 100%; font-size: 13.5px; }
th, td { text-align: left; padding: 7px 10px; border-bottom: 1px solid var(--line); vertical-align: top; }
th { font-size: 12px; text-transform: uppercase; letter-spacing: .06em; color: var(--muted); font-weight: 600; }
tr:last-child > td { border-bottom: 0; }
.scroll { overflow-x: auto; }
table.kv th { width: 210px; text-transform: none; letter-spacing: 0; font-size: 13.5px; }
td { overflow-wrap: anywhere; }

.badge {
  display: inline-block; min-width: 68px; text-align: center; padding: 2px 9px; border-radius: 999px;
  font-size: 11px; font-weight: 700; letter-spacing: .07em; text-transform: uppercase;
  color: #fff; background: var(--sev);
}
@media (prefers-color-scheme: dark) { .badge { color: #10141a; } }
.status-ran { color: var(--muted); } .status-skipped { color: var(--muted); font-style: italic; }
.status-error { color: var(--high); font-weight: 600; }

.authz { border-left: 4px solid var(--accent); }
.finding { margin-bottom: 16px; border-left: 5px solid var(--sev); }
.finding h3 { font-size: 17px; display: flex; gap: 10px; align-items: baseline; flex-wrap: wrap; }
.finding h3 .t { flex: 1 1 300px; }
.meta { display: flex; flex-wrap: wrap; gap: 4px 18px; margin: 8px 0 12px; font-size: 12.5px; color: var(--muted); }
.meta b { color: var(--ink); font-weight: 600; }
.finding h4 { font-size: 12px; text-transform: uppercase; letter-spacing: .07em; color: var(--muted); margin: 14px 0 4px; }
details.evidence { margin-top: 8px; border: 1px solid var(--line); border-radius: 8px; }
details.evidence > summary { cursor: pointer; padding: 8px 12px; font-size: 13px; font-weight: 600; }
details.evidence .body { padding: 0 12px 12px; }
.evidence .label { font-size: 11px; text-transform: uppercase; letter-spacing: .07em; color: var(--muted); margin: 8px 0 3px; }
pre {
  margin: 0; background: var(--code-bg); color: var(--code-ink); border-radius: 6px; padding: 10px 12px;
  overflow-x: auto; white-space: pre-wrap; overflow-wrap: anywhere; max-height: 340px; overflow-y: auto;
}
.note { color: var(--muted); font-size: 13px; }
ul.plain { margin: 0; padding-left: 18px; }
footer { margin-top: 48px; padding-top: 16px; border-top: 1px solid var(--line); color: var(--muted); font-size: 12.5px; }

@media (max-width: 720px) {
  .tiles { grid-template-columns: repeat(2, 1fr); }
  table.kv th { width: 120px; }
}
@media print {
  body { background: #fff; font-size: 12px; }
  .page { max-width: none; padding: 0; }
  nav.toc { display: none; }
  .card, .tile { break-inside: avoid; }
  pre { max-height: none; }
  h2 { break-after: avoid; }
}
</style>
</head>
<body>
<div class="page">

{% macro render(value) -%}
  {%- if value is mapping -%}
    <table class="kv">
    {% for key, item in value.items() %}
      <tr><th>{{ key }}</th><td>{{ render(item) }}</td></tr>
    {% endfor %}
    </table>
  {%- elif value is sequence and value is not string -%}
    {%- if value and value[0] is mapping -%}
      <div class="scroll"><table>
      <tr>{% for key in value[0].keys() %}<th>{{ key }}</th>{% endfor %}</tr>
      {% for row in value %}
        <tr>{% for cell in row.values() %}<td>{{ cell }}</td>{% endfor %}</tr>
      {% endfor %}
      </table></div>
    {%- elif not value -%}
      <span class="note">none found</span>
    {%- else -%}
      {% for item in value %}<code>{{ item }}</code>{% if not loop.last %} {% endif %}{% endfor %}
    {%- endif -%}
  {%- else -%}
    {{ value }}
  {%- endif -%}
{%- endmacro %}

<header class="cover">
  <div class="brand">AegisScan · Security assessment report</div>
  <h1>{{ result.target.host }}</h1>
  <div class="target"><code>{{ result.target.url }}</code></div>
  <div class="facts">
    <span><b>Scanned</b> {{ result.started_at.strftime("%d %B %Y, %H:%M UTC") }}</span>
    <span><b>Duration</b> {{ result.duration_seconds }} s</span>
    <span><b>Requests sent</b> {{ result.requests_sent }} HTTP{% if result.dns_queries %}, {{ result.dns_queries }} DNS{% endif %}</span>
    <span><b>Tool</b> {{ result.tool }} {{ result.version }}</span>
  </div>
  <nav class="toc">
    <a href="#summary">Executive summary</a>
    <a href="#scope">Scope and authorization</a>
    <a href="#findings">Findings</a>
    {% if result.observations %}<a href="#recon">Reconnaissance</a>{% endif %}
    <a href="#checks">Checks performed</a>
    <a href="#method">Method and limits</a>
  </nav>
</header>

<h2 id="summary">Executive summary</h2>
<div class="tiles">
  {% for name in severities %}
  <div class="tile {{ name }}{% if not summary.by_severity[name] %} zero{% endif %}">
    <div class="n">{{ summary.by_severity[name] }}</div><div class="l">{{ name }}</div>
  </div>
  {% endfor %}
</div>
{% if summary.total %}
<div class="bar" role="img" aria-label="Findings by severity">
  {% for name in severities %}{% if summary.by_severity[name] %}<span class="{{ name }}" style="flex: {{ summary.by_severity[name] }}" title="{{ summary.by_severity[name] }} {{ name }}"></span>{% endif %}{% endfor %}
</div>
{% endif %}
<div class="card">
  {% for paragraph in narrative %}<p>{{ paragraph }}</p>{% endfor %}
  {% if result.findings %}
  <div class="scroll"><table style="margin-top: 8px">
    <tr><th>Severity</th><th>Finding</th><th>CVSS</th><th>Check</th></tr>
    {% for finding in result.findings %}
    <tr>
      <td><span class="badge {{ finding.severity.value }}">{{ finding.severity.value }}</span></td>
      <td><a href="#{{ finding.id }}">{{ finding.title }}</a></td>
      <td>{{ "%.1f"|format(finding.cvss_score) if finding.cvss_score is not none else "–" }}</td>
      <td><code>{{ finding.check_id }}</code></td>
    </tr>
    {% endfor %}
  </table></div>
  {% endif %}
</div>

<h2 id="scope">Scope and authorization</h2>
<div class="card authz">
  <table class="kv">
    <tr><th>Authorization asserted by</th><td>{{ result.authorization.detail }}</td></tr>
    {% if result.authorization.asserted_by %}
    <tr><th>Asserted by</th><td>{{ result.authorization.asserted_by }}, on {{ result.authorization.date }} (basis: {{ result.authorization.basis }})</td></tr>
    {% endif %}
    <tr><th>Recorded at</th><td>{{ result.authorization.timestamp.strftime("%Y-%m-%d %H:%M:%S UTC") }}</td></tr>
    <tr><th>Hosts in scope</th><td>{% for host in result.scope_hosts %}<code>{{ host }}</code> {% endfor %}{% if result.include_subdomains %}and their subdomains{% endif %}</td></tr>
    {% if result.exclude_paths %}
    <tr><th>Excluded paths</th><td>{% for path in result.exclude_paths %}<code>{{ path }}</code> {% endfor %}</td></tr>
    {% endif %}
    <tr><th>Out of scope, not contacted</th><td>
      {% if out_of_scope_hosts %}
        {% for host in out_of_scope_hosts %}<code>{{ host }}</code> {% endfor %}
      {% else %}<span class="note">No other hosts were encountered.</span>{% endif %}
    </td></tr>
  </table>
  <p class="note" style="margin: 10px 0 0">Only the hosts in scope were contacted. Links, redirects and subdomains leading elsewhere were recorded and not followed.</p>
</div>
{% if result.out_of_scope %}
<details class="evidence" style="margin-top: 10px">
  <summary>Out-of-scope references seen during the scan ({{ result.out_of_scope|length }})</summary>
  <div class="body scroll"><table>
    <tr><th>Host</th><th>Seen as</th><th>Reference</th><th>Where</th></tr>
    {% for record in result.out_of_scope %}
    <tr><td><code>{{ record.host }}</code></td><td>{{ record.reason }}</td><td>{{ record.url or "–" }}</td><td>{{ record.source }}</td></tr>
    {% endfor %}
  </table></div>
</details>
{% endif %}

<h2 id="findings">Findings</h2>
{% if not result.findings %}
<div class="card"><p>No findings.</p></div>
{% endif %}
{% for name, items in grouped.items() %}
{% for finding in items %}
<article class="card finding {{ name }}" id="{{ finding.id }}">
  <h3><span class="badge {{ name }}">{{ name }}</span><span class="t">{{ finding.title }}</span></h3>
  <div class="meta">
    <span><b>Check</b> <code>{{ finding.check_id }}</code></span>
    {% if finding.cvss_vector %}<span><b>CVSS 3.1</b> {{ "%.1f"|format(finding.cvss_score) }} <code>{{ finding.cvss_vector }}</code></span>{% endif %}
    {% if finding.cwe %}<span><b>Weakness</b> {% if finding.cwe|cwe_url %}<a href="{{ finding.cwe|cwe_url }}">{{ finding.cwe }}</a>{% else %}{{ finding.cwe }}{% endif %}</span>{% endif %}
    {% if finding.owasp %}<span><b>OWASP</b> {{ finding.owasp }}</span>{% endif %}
  </div>
  <h4>Location</h4>
  <p><code>{{ finding.url }}</code></p>
  <h4>What this means</h4>
  <p>{{ finding.description }}</p>
  <h4>Why it was flagged</h4>
  <p>{{ finding.why }}</p>
  <h4>Remediation</h4>
  <p>{{ finding.remediation }}</p>
  <h4>Evidence</h4>
  {% for item in finding.evidence %}
  <details class="evidence" open>
    <summary>{{ item.kind|upper }} evidence {{ loop.index }} of {{ finding.evidence|length }}{% if item.note %}: {{ item.note|truncate(110) }}{% endif %}</summary>
    <div class="body">
      <div class="label">Sent</div>
      <pre>{{ item.request }}</pre>
      <div class="label">Received</div>
      <pre>{{ item.response }}</pre>
    </div>
  </details>
  {% endfor %}
</article>
{% endfor %}
{% endfor %}

{% if result.observations %}
<h2 id="recon">Reconnaissance</h2>
<p class="note">What the scan learned about the target that is not in itself a weakness.</p>
{% for key, value in result.observations|dictsort %}
<div class="card" style="margin-bottom: 12px">
  <h3 style="font-size: 15px; margin-bottom: 8px">{{ key|heading }}</h3>
  {{ render(value) }}
</div>
{% endfor %}
{% endif %}

<h2 id="checks">Checks performed</h2>
<div class="card scroll">
  <table>
    <tr><th>Check</th><th>Category</th><th>Result</th><th>Findings</th><th>Time</th></tr>
    {% for run in result.checks %}
    <tr>
      <td><code>{{ run.check.id }}</code><br>{{ run.check.title }}</td>
      <td>{{ run.check.category }}</td>
      <td class="status-{{ run.status }}">
        {% if run.status == "ran" %}completed{% elif run.status == "skipped" %}not applicable{% else %}failed{% endif %}
        {% if run.detail %}<br><span class="note">{{ run.detail }}</span>{% endif %}
      </td>
      <td>{{ run.findings }}</td>
      <td>{{ run.duration_ms }} ms</td>
    </tr>
    {% endfor %}
  </table>
</div>

<h2 id="method">Method and limits</h2>
<div class="card">
  <ul class="plain">
    <li><b>Non-destructive.</b> Every check sends benign, read-only requests (GET, HEAD, OPTIONS, TLS handshakes, DNS lookups) and analyses the response. Nothing was modified, and file contents and secrets were not extracted: evidence excerpts are short and secret values are masked.</li>
    <li><b>Scope.</b> Requests were rate limited and sent only to the hosts listed under Scope and authorization.</li>
    <li><b>Coverage.</b> This is an automated assessment of configuration and exposure for a single URL. It does not crawl the application, log in, or test for injection flaws, and it is not a substitute for a manual penetration test. The absence of a finding is not proof of the absence of a weakness.</li>
    <li><b>Severity.</b> Ratings are CVSS v3.1 base scores for the weakness in general. Adjust them for what this system holds and who can reach it.</li>
  </ul>
</div>

<footer>
  Generated by {{ result.tool }} {{ result.version }} on {{ result.finished_at.strftime("%Y-%m-%d %H:%M UTC") }}.
  For authorized security testing only. This report describes weaknesses in the named system: handle it as confidential.
</footer>

</div>
</body>
</html>
